		(property "Description" "Hull-air SHT41: the Teyleten Robot GY-SHT41-D module soldered straight onto the carrier's underside on its 0.1 in header, sensor side down, away from the Pi's heat. It has no regulator, so VIN must stay on 3V3 (the SHT41 is 3.6 V max); its 10k pull-ups then sit at the Pico's 3.3 V."
