		(at 169.66 70.5 90)
		(descr "Raspberry Pi Pico / Pico 2, socketed on two 1x20 female headers (8.5 mm). Same pads, outline and 3D models as RaspberryPi_Pico_Common_THT, but the courtyard covers only the two socket rows and the USB end, so flat parts may sit under the module: keep them under ~7 mm tall. The micro-USB receptacle outline is on F.Fab only, so pads may sit under it. 3D: the 8.5 mm sockets with a Pico H seated in them. D.R.E.A.M.S V3.1, 2026-10-10.")
